<div style="font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:10px;color:#999;padding:4px 14px 10px;font-style:italic;">Source: Bank of Canada Valet API (total CPI year-over-year, CPI-trim, CPI-median), from Statistics Canada data; HDQ calculations. &nbsp;|&nbsp; hdq.ca</div>
